{#
  TOAST — Figma 1126:30853. "Portfolio '26 is in progress."

  WHEN IT SHOWS: the first homepage load in a browser tab, and again after a
  hard refresh (⌘⇧R / Ctrl+Shift+R / Ctrl+F5). Not on a normal refresh, and not
  when coming back from a case study. A page cannot tell a hard refresh from a
  normal one, so scripts/v4-toast.js notes the hard-refresh keys as they are
  pressed, and the check below reads that note. The check runs before the toast
  is drawn, so a skipped toast never flashes. It is per tab (sessionStorage):
  a new tab or a new visit shows it again.

  Once up, it is gone after 10 seconds: the darker band behind it is the timer,
  filling from left to right, and the toast fades out when it is full
  (_toast.css). The × closes it at once. Hovering or focusing it pauses the
  timer, so it never vanishes while someone is reading it.

  The ring is two exported assets, not a drawn progress arc: the comp's arc is a
  fixed shape (with the spark at its tip), not a value-driven one.
#}
<script>
  try {
    var seen = sessionStorage.getItem("v4-toast-seen");
    var hard = sessionStorage.getItem("v4-hard-reload");
    sessionStorage.removeItem("v4-hard-reload");
    if (seen && !hard) document.documentElement.classList.add("is-toast-skipped");
    sessionStorage.setItem("v4-toast-seen", "1");
  } catch (e) {}
</script>
<aside class="v4-toast" data-toast aria-label="Site status">
  <div class="v4-toast__body">
    <div class="v4-toast__ring" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="v4-toast__ring-track" src="/Assets/v4/icons/toast-ring-track.svg" width="40" height="40" alt="" />
      <img class="v4-toast__ring-arc" src="/Assets/v4/icons/toast-ring-progress.svg" width="20" height="36" alt="" />
      <img class="v4-toast__ring-spark" src="/Assets/v4/icons/toast-spark.svg" width="6" height="6" alt="" />
      <span class="v4-toast__ring-value">{{ home.toast.progress }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="v4-toast__text">
      <p class="v4-toast__title">{{ home.toast.title }}</p>
      <p class="v4-toast__detail">{{ home.toast.body }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <button class="v4-toast__close" type="button" data-toast-close aria-label="Dismiss">
    <img src="/Assets/v4/icons/cross.svg" width="20" height="20" alt="" />
  </button>
</aside>
